        "evidence": [
          {
            "index": 3042,
            "source_segment_index": 3042,
            "start_ms": 5866545,
            "end_ms": 5872445,
            "text": "同时特别感谢蓝赤霞联盟共和国以及哦特别感谢我们柠檬共和国，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3043,
            "source_segment_index": 3043,
            "start_ms": 5872445,
            "end_ms": 5873365,
            "text": "还有哈尼牧场。"
          },
          {
            "index": 3044,
            "source_segment_index": 3044,
            "start_ms": 5873365,
            "end_ms": 5879385,
            "text": "对我们节目的特约赞助支持我们第二局游戏的版型是哦鬼畜之境。"
          },
          {
            "index": 3045,
            "source_segment_index": 3045,
            "start_ms": 5879385,
            "end_ms": 5879765,
            "text": "各位弹幕，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3046,
            "source_segment_index": 3046,
            "start_ms": 5879765,
            "end_ms": 5883465,
            "text": "老师们可以到我们的官博先行了解一下文字版的版型规则介绍。"
          },
          {
            "index": 3047,
            "source_segment_index": 3047,
            "start_ms": 5883465,
            "end_ms": 5885485,
            "text": "就在我们的呃置顶的部分。"
          },
          {
            "index": 3048,
            "source_segment_index": 3048,
            "start_ms": 5885505,
            "end_ms": 5889335,
            "text": "同时呢也希望各位大宝师们都能在这个小时帮我们送一下人气票，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3049,
            "source_segment_index": 3049,
            "start_ms": 5889335,
            "end_ms": 5890095,
            "text": "在下方礼物签单，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3050,
            "source_segment_index": 3050,
            "start_ms": 5890095,
            "end_ms": 5891140,
            "text": "找到人气票的学校，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3051,
            "source_segment_index": 3051,
            "start_ms": 5891345,
            "end_ms": 5891885,
            "text": "一毛一张，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3052,
            "source_segment_index": 3052,
            "start_ms": 5891885,
            "end_ms": 5893770,
            "text": "最多可以拉满六百张有效的日期票。"
          },
          {
            "index": 3053,
            "source_segment_index": 3053,
            "start_ms": 5894035,
            "end_ms": 5894915,
            "text": "第一张非常关键，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3054,
            "source_segment_index": 3054,
            "start_ms": 5894915,
            "end_ms": 5896635,
            "text": "可以帮我们增长额外两百的人气值。"
          },
          {
            "index": 3055,
            "source_segment_index": 3055,
            "start_ms": 5896635,
            "end_ms": 5897550,
            "text": "感谢各位的支持，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3056,
            "source_segment_index": 3056,
            "start_ms": 5897925,
            "end_ms": 5899765,
            "text": "接下来把镜头给到第二现场上回来。"
          },
          {
            "index": 3057,
            "source_segment_index": 3057,
            "start_ms": 5899765,
            "end_ms": 5901780,
            "text": "我们今天的第二局游戏鬼畜之境。"
          },
          {
            "index": 3058,
            "source_segment_index": 3058,
            "start_ms": 5905165,
            "end_ms": 5905600,
            "text": "嗯，"
          },
          {
            "index": 3059,
            "source_segment_index": 3059,
            "start_ms": 5906165,
            "end_ms": 5908405,
            "text": "OKOK欢迎回来呃，"
          }
